{% macro breadcrumb(items, container, spacing, opts) %}
{# Nunjucks macros are scope-isolated: `lang` is only visible when the caller
   imports with `with context`. Derive the locale from the first crumb's URL
   (always the language home) as a fallback so the aria-label stays localized
   even on templates that import without context.

   Only one variant is in use: the flat, single-line breadcrumb that sits inside
   a page hero (all 344 call sites pass `variant: "hero"` explicitly, incl. the
   192 blog articles). The former default variant — an <ol>/<li> microdata
   BreadcrumbList wrapped in a container div — was never reached and was removed
   on 2026-09-20. Rationale for the surviving variant:
     - no <ol>/<li> wrapper and no schema.org microdata: blog articles already
       emit a JSON-LD BreadcrumbList, so microdata here would duplicate it
     - 14px slate-500 instead of 13px slate-400: slate-400 on white is only
       ~2.6:1 contrast and fails WCAG AA, slate-500 is ~4.6:1
     - the current crumb is slate-900 rather than brand orange
   opts.sep is the separator markup. Canonical form is
   ' <span class="mx-2">/</span> ' (2026-09-13: the site had two forms — a bare
   " / " and the span — so the span form became the macro default and every
   call site dropped its explicit sep). Only pass sep for a deliberate exception.

   opts.dark == true is for the variant on a dark background (the six
   404 pages are bg-brandBlue). The default palette is tuned for white:
   the current crumb is slate-900, which is ~1.0:1 on brandBlue — i.e. invisible.
   Dark mode swaps the base to slate-300 and the current crumb to white.

   `container` (2nd positional arg) is retained for call-site compatibility and
   is intentionally unused. #}
{% set o = opts or {} %}{% set lc = lang or ((items[0].url or "/") | replace("/", "")) or "en" %}
{% set ariaMap = {
  "en": "Breadcrumb",
  "de": "Brotkrumennavigation",
  "es": "Migas de pan",
  "fr": "Fil d'Ariane",
  "ru": "Хлебные крошки",
  "pl": "Ścieżka nawigacji"
} %}
{# 原 hero 分支的 if 条件已删除；本行作为占位保留，以维持产物空白字节与改动前完全一致 #}
{% set sep = o.sep or ' <span class="mx-2">/</span> ' %}{% set baseC = 'text-slate-300' if o.dark else 'text-slate-500' %}{% set curC = 'text-white' if o.dark else 'text-slate-900' %}
<nav aria-label="{{ ariaMap[lc] or 'Breadcrumb' }}" class="text-sm {{ baseC }} {{ spacing or 'mb-6' }}">
{%- for item in items %}
 {% if item.url %}<a href="{{ item.url }}" class="hover:text-brandOrange">{{ item.name }}</a>{% else %}<span class="{{ curC }}">{{ item.name }}</span>{% endif %}{% if not loop.last %}{{ sep | safe }}{% endif %}
{%- endfor %}
</nav>
{% endmacro %}
